Package: bibliolatam
Title: Latin American Bibliographic Data Parsers for 'bibliometrix'
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Gabriel", "Gama", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "contato@bran.org"),
    person(given = "BRAN Org", role = "cph")
  )
Description: Provides parsers and conversion pipelines to adapt Latin
    American open-access bibliographic databases (such as SciELO, SPELL,
    BDTD, Redalyc, and LA Referencia) into standardized data frames
    compatible with 'bibliometrix' and 'biblioshiny'.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
URL: https://github.com/BRAN-Org/bibliolatam
BugReports: https://github.com/BRAN-Org/bibliolatam/issues
Imports: 
    jsonlite,
    utils,
    tools
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    bibliometrix,
    shiny,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
